a fifty-fifty chance of happening

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:54.530
and make it happen ten times in a row,

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:57.930
you get a phenomenon that only has 
a 1 in 1,024 chance of happening.

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:02.730
You can toss a coin and have it come 
up heads 10,000 times in a row.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:06.730
