00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:50.720
Correct.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.870
But if you look at it another way,

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:55.110
it's because this assembly 
bears no responsibility

00:20:55.110 --> 00:21:00.190
that nothing will hold them back. 
Not the law, justice, or even the truth.

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:04.190
Even if the solution is unjust or untrue,

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:06.140
as long as the majority 
of the tens of thousands

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:08.300
of the site viewers support it, we win.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:08.950
<b>Nameless</b>

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:08.950
<b>Anon</b>

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:11.040
If we present a plausible story

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:14.120
that fits with enough of the 
facts and is interesting enough,

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:17.430
the masses will irresponsibly 
support it and vote in our favor.

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:21.710
Which means anything goes 
with this committee.

00:21:22.770 --> 00:21:27.120
We can obscure and hide the 
real data, call black "white,"

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:29.600
and present several contradicting answers.

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:35.100
As long as they seem reasonable at a 
glance and are entertaining enough...

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:39.310
Then we can turn fiction into fact.

00:21:40.470 --> 00:21:42.750
We can actually get away with that here.

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:51.390
I will stop at nothing to win.

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:54.670
I will put everything I have into these lies.

